### Health Check
GET http://localhost:8080/api/health

### Setup Webhook
POST http://localhost:8080/api/admin/webhook/setup?url=https://yourdomain.com/api/webhook/update

### Remove Webhook (Enable Polling)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/admin/webhook/remove

### Get Webhook Info
GET http://localhost:8080/api/admin/webhook/info

### Setup Bot Commands
POST http://localhost:8080/api/admin/commands/setup

### Test Webhook Update (Manual Test)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/webhook/update
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "update_id": 1,
    "message": {
        "message_id": 1,
        "date": 1234567890,
        "chat": {
            "id": 123456789,
            "type": "private"
        },
        "from": {
            "id": 123456789,
            "is_bot": false,
            "first_name": "Test"
        },
        "text": "/start"
    }
}
